request.description:
Returns business info for the current tenant.
Requires auth session cookie (see folder description).

Expected: 200 { business_hours, services, address, phone, extra_notes, custom_instructions, updated_at }
If not logged in: 401 { error: 'Unauthorized' }

Creates a new tenant. Only works if the signed-in user has isAdmin: true in their session.

Expected: 303 redirect to /admin on success.
If not admin: 401 { error: 'Unauthorized' }
If name is missing: 400 { error: 'Name is required' }

Also accepts multipart/form-data with fields 'name' and 'twilioPhone'.
